---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Text from '../components/blocks/Text.astro';
import socialShare6a8726b0 from '../assets/images/social-share-6a8726b0.png';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Ensure Your Privacy Today – Learn More | HelloSEO" description="Review HelloSEO's privacy policy to understand data handling and user privacy practices. Stay informed about your privacy rights with our transparent policies." ogImage={socialShare6a8726b0} headerTheme="bright">
  <Section theme="bright" divider={{ height: '6vw', stroke: 'var(--lightAccent)', strokeWidth: '8px' }} grid={{ rows: [5, 5], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="3/2/5/10" d="3/10/6/18" z={1} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h1 class="ta-center"><span class="c-darkAccent">Privacy Policy</span></h1>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" grid={{ rows: [19, 87], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }} prevDivider="6vw">
    <Text m="2/2/19/10" d="3/3/80/25" z={2}>
      <p>HelloSEO, LLC (“Company,” “we,” or “us”) is committed to protecting your data and respecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, store, use, share, and protect your information.</p>
      <p>Before using <a href="http://helloseo.com"><strong>helloseo.com</strong></a> (the “Site”), please read this Privacy Policy carefully. By using the Site, you agree to this Privacy Policy, meaning you accept and are bound by its terms. If you do not agree, you must stop using the Site immediately.</p>
      <p>This Privacy Policy, together with our Terms and Conditions of Use, governs your access to and use of the Site, including any content and services offered. By accessing the Site, we may collect certain information about you, both automatically and through your actions. This Policy applies to all such information, whether collected automatically or voluntarily.</p>
      <h3>Personal Information We Collect</h3>
      <p>When you interact with our Site—by filling out forms, subscribing to our newsletter, searching for information, purchasing services, or contacting us—we collect and process your data to improve performance, deliver services, and provide offers and promotions.</p>
      <h3>What Information Do We Collect?</h3>
      <p><strong>Voluntarily Provided Information:</strong><br>This may include your name, email address, mailing address, phone number, payment details, or other personal information you provide when interacting with us.</p>
      <p><strong>Automatically Collected Information:</strong><br>We may use tools like Google Analytics to collect non-personal information about your device, browser, IP address, operating system, browsing behavior, location, and site usage. This information is used for statistical purposes to improve the Site’s functionality and user experience.</p>
      <p><strong>Cookies and Tracking Technologies:</strong><br>We use cookies to recognize returning users, remember preferences, and improve your experience. Cookies may also be used for advertising purposes. You can manage or disable cookies in your browser settings, though doing so may affect certain functionalities of the Site.</p>
      <h3>Third-Party Cookies</h3>
      <p>Some content or features on the Site, such as advertisements or embedded media, may be provided by third parties. These third parties may use cookies or tracking technologies to collect information about you. We do not control their tracking methods, so direct any inquiries to those third parties.</p>
      <h3>Email Policies</h3>
      <p>If you communicate with us via email, we may retain your message and email address. Your email address will not be sold, rented, or shared with third parties, except as described in this Privacy Policy. You can unsubscribe from our mailing list at any time by following the link provided in promotional emails.</p>
      <h3>Why We Collect Your Information</h3>
      <p>We collect your information to:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p>Improve our services and website performance.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Provide relevant offers and updates based on your preferences.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Fulfill your requests, such as signing up for our newsletter or purchasing a service.</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
      <h3>How We Use Your Information</h3>
      <p>Your information may be used for:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p>Auditing ad impressions and ensuring compliance with advertising standards.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Debugging and improving our website functionality.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Marketing purposes, including providing relevant advertising (excluding cross-context behavioral advertising).</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Managing business records and legal obligations.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Contractual or legitimate interests (e.g., improving user experience).</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
      <h3>How We Store, Protect, and Share Your Information</h3>
      <p>We store your information securely and only for as long as necessary to fulfill our business and legal obligations.</p>
      <p><strong>Your information may be shared with:</strong></p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p>Affiliates and service providers, such as payment processors and email delivery systems.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Legal authorities when required by law.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Third parties assisting with business functions, such as hosting services.</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
      <p>We use commercially reasonable methods to protect your data but encourage you not to share sensitive or confidential information via the Site.</p>
      <h3>Embedded Content</h3>
      <p>Our Site may include embedded content (e.g., videos, images, articles) from other websites. This content behaves the same as if you visited the other website directly and may collect data or track your interactions.</p>
      <h3>Your Rights (GDPR and CCPA)</h3>
      <p><strong>If you are an EU resident:</strong><br>You have the right to access, correct, delete, or restrict the processing of your data. You may also withdraw your consent or lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority.</p>
      <p><strong>If you are a California resident:</strong><br>Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), you have the right to opt out of the sale of your personal information and to request details about how your information is used. HelloSEO does not sell personal information without your consent.</p>
      <h3>Children’s Privacy</h3>
      <p>Our Site is intended for individuals aged 18 and older. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 18. If we become aware of such information, we will delete it.</p>
      <h3>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>
      <p>HelloSEO reserves the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. Changes will be posted here, and material updates may be communicated via email if applicable.</p>
      <h3>Comments and Concerns</h3>
      <p>This website is operated by HelloSEO. For questions or feedback about this Privacy Policy, contact us at:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:team@helloseo.com">team@helloseo.com</a></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://helloseo.com/contact">https://helloseo.com/contact</a></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><strong>Address: </strong>1501 Richland Street Columbia, SC 29201</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
    </Text>
  </Section>
</Layout>
